[Mission.Objectives]
Destroy the enemy defenses in the area specified.
[Mission.Description]
Ahead of our positions the Americans have established a fortified position centered around a small town. According to our scouts, roughly a company of infantry are in position supported by 57mm AT guns as well as 105mm Howitzers.
 
Your orders:
- Using the forces a under your command, attack the enemy positions and drive them off.
[Mission.Success]
Well done Commander! The enemy defense is broken.
[Mission.Failed]
Mission failed! Your command has been defeated.
[Submission_1.Objectives]
Capture the village.
[Submission_1.Description]
Flank the main enemy defensive position in order to secure the town.
 
Your orders:
- Capture the village. 
[Submission_1.Success]
Well done commander! The village has been captured.
[Submission_1.Failed]
Mission failed! Your  troops are eliminated.